{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", "domain": "relationship", "question": "在2022壬寅年，以下哪项是命主的婚姻经历？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "命主八字为庚申 甲申 庚午 甲申。日主庚金生于申月，得三申禄，金气极旺。女命以正官为夫星，原局夫星丁火暗藏日支午中，但午火孤立无援，被旺金耗泄，婚姻根基不稳。日主强而夫星弱，比肩林立，一生易有情缘纷争，自主性强。\n\n2022年壬寅，正行庚辰大运。流年天干壬水为食神，食神主欲望与对丈夫的挑剔，且壬水克夫星丁火，强化排斥。地支寅木为偏财，与日支夫妻宫午火半合（寅午合火），引动情感；然寅与命局三申相冲（寅申冲），形成驿马冲动，主突发变故与分离。大运庚辰比肩助身，辰土泄火生金，更不利夫星。综合判断，是命主自身有外情，因寅午合引动偏缘，寅申冲则致冲突暴露。夫宫严重受冲克，难获原谅，当年即离婚。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b2b_R0_P2_G0\\details_2024_b2b_R0_P2_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 38539, "response_id": "f3950895-bfd8-4e59-8d7b-c00ead9decac", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 294, "completion_tokens": 2487, "total_tokens": 2781, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2227}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 166}}
